## Genesis semantics

**AIEF-AMD-003 §AMD-10.** `state` is `genesis` or `active`. The transition ran once, at
`S-2026-08-12-01`, and is irreversible. Full rule: `L-0000001`.

## Write order at session close

Entry file -> flush -> `HEAD` -> `STATE.md` -> release lock. Segments seal every 500 entries.

